# NOTICE

This repository includes an adapted copy of **ReSeqt 1.0.1**.

- Upstream project: ReSeqt
- Author: vaaloo (Valentin Gorgodian)
- Project website: https://reseqt.vaaloo.fr
- Source repository: https://github.com/vaaloo/reseqt
- License: MIT (see LICENSE.reseqt)

The viewer source is vendored in `viewer-app/src/reseqt/` with the adaptations
listed below. The plugin glue code (DSH integration, alignment
format normalization, format settings UI, build scripts, and documentation) is
MIT-licensed; see LICENSE.

Adaptations made for the DSH plugin:

- `ReSeqtProps` gained an optional `height` override so the viewer can fill a
  sidebar iframe; the default 14 px cell size is used instead of 22 px.
- Narrow-sidebar media rules tighten the toolbar and hide duplicate metrics.
- The viewer renders as a single-file Vite build inside a Blob iframe and
  receives FASTA text over the `dsh-seq-viewer:ready` / `:load` / `:loaded`
  postMessage protocol.
- The host detects the DSH theme and forwards it; the embedded viewer also
  handles explicit theme updates.
- CLUSTAL / PHYLIP / Stockholm parsing, gzip handling, and nucleotide /
  protein detection live in the plugin glue, not in the upstream component.

